From: nvb-uy <105564560+nvb-uy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: Do not auto-hint fonts without hinting instructions.

Same as the dwrite change for GDI text: use a font's own instructions and never invent them.
---
diff --git a/dlls/win32u/freetype.c b/dlls/win32u/freetype.c
--- a/dlls/win32u/freetype.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/freetype.c
@@ -3088,7 +3088,7 @@ static FT_Int get_load_flags( UINT format )
         break;
     }
 
-    return load_flags;
+    return load_flags | FT_LOAD_NO_AUTOHINT;
 }
 
 /*************************************************************
